      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْمَهِرٌّ</span></b>  A <i>tough</i> thorn. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  A penis <i>hard
and strong;</i> or <i>distended and erect and hard:</i>
(L, TA: [but in both, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عود</span>, as an epithet applied
to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَكَرٌ</span>, is put by mistake for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَردٌ</span>]:) or the <i>penis</i>
[itself]. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>Straight.</i> (AZ.)

